---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<!-- Temporary. Delete after checking tokens. -->
<Base title="dev-check">
	<main class="grid" style="padding-block: 2rem; row-gap: 1rem;">
		<h1 class="display" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">Love&amp;Hate<br />AI</h1>

		<div style="grid-column: 1 / -1;"><hr /></div>

		<section class="cols">
			<h2 class="title">Title <span class="muted">Project 01</span></h2>
			<p class="lead">Bold lead paragraph, body size.</p>
			<p>
				Body text at fifteen pixels. Emphasis is <em>oblique, not bold</em>. A <a href="#x">link keeps the text color</a> and
				is underlined. Numbers: <span class="tnum">0123456789</span> and €5 ™ ≤ ≥ ≈ ∞ π ↗ ← → …
			</p>
			<p>Second paragraph. It should indent the first line and sit directly under the first with no gap, as on the detail page.</p>
			<p class="muted">Credits: muted gray, bottom of column 1.</p>
			<p class="mono muted">figure 3.1 · mono caption · lowercase</p>
			<p>Fallback: Привіт, Ελληνικά, Tiếng Việt, Łódź, Ŝŝ.</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Bulleted list hangs about two ems in, and a long wrapped line aligns with the text and not with the bullet.</li>
				<li>Second item.</li>
			</ul>
			<button type="button" style="font: inherit; color: inherit; background: none; border: 0; padding: 0; text-decoration: underline; cursor: pointer;">Focus me</button>
		</section>

		<div class="inset-demo" style="grid-column: 1 / -1; background: var(--inset); aspect-ratio: 16 / 6; padding: 1rem;">
			<p class="muted mono">inset · muted on inset</p>
			<p>text on inset</p>
		</div>
	</main>

	<style>
		.cols {
			display: contents;
		}
		.cols > * {
			grid-column: 1 / -1;
		}
		@media (min-width: 48rem) {
			.cols > * {
				grid-column: 2 / 7;
			}
			.cols > p + p:not(.lead):not(.muted):not(.mono) {
				text-indent: 4em;
			}
		}
	</style>
</Base>
